    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy in the Hand</strong>\u00a0is a Lovecraftian action horror game that puts the weight of the action directly into the player's hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Action Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master a <i>single-action revolver</i>\u00a0to fight off cosmic horrors and descend further into the abyss beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/4cf98bee29d5a3d2d75615d438821c63.poster.avif?t=1746041652\" width=600 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/4cf98bee29d5a3d2d75615d438821c63.webm?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/4cf98bee29d5a3d2d75615d438821c63.mp4?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eldritch horrors hide and attack from the shadows. Your vision is limited, and you can only shoot what you can see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/d07340ad25b864ffe4e6a760272400c4.poster.avif?t=1746041652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/d07340ad25b864ffe4e6a760272400c4.webm?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/d07340ad25b864ffe4e6a760272400c4.mp4?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eldritch Horrors </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to shoot the horrors you can comprehend. But will you survive the horrors you cannot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/2b62a29e028dfc66d84b1cb6c0567b2f.poster.avif?t=1746041652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/2b62a29e028dfc66d84b1cb6c0567b2f.webm?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/2b62a29e028dfc66d84b1cb6c0567b2f.mp4?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay no mind to the length of your gaze into those deep places - the void has always stared back.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy in the Hand</strong>\u00a0is a Lovecraftian action horror game that puts the weight of the action directly into the player's hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Action Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master a <i>single-action revolver</i>\u00a0to fight off cosmic horrors and descend further into the abyss beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/4cf98bee29d5a3d2d75615d438821c63.poster.avif?t=1746041652\" width=600 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/4cf98bee29d5a3d2d75615d438821c63.webm?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/4cf98bee29d5a3d2d75615d438821c63.mp4?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Vision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eldritch horrors hide and attack from the shadows. Your vision is limited, and you can only shoot what you can see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/d07340ad25b864ffe4e6a760272400c4.poster.avif?t=1746041652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/d07340ad25b864ffe4e6a760272400c4.webm?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/d07340ad25b864ffe4e6a760272400c4.mp4?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eldritch Horrors </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to shoot the horrors you can comprehend. But will you survive the horrors you cannot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/2b62a29e028dfc66d84b1cb6c0567b2f.poster.avif?t=1746041652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/2b62a29e028dfc66d84b1cb6c0567b2f.webm?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643740/extras/2b62a29e028dfc66d84b1cb6c0567b2f.mp4?t=1746041652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay no mind to the length of your gaze into those deep places - the void has always stared back.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cock the hammer, pull the trigger, count to six. Release the cylinder, eject the shells, count to six again. You hold death in your hand, and death is heavy. Descend to the abyss, shoot the horrors you can comprehend, and survive the horrors you cannot.",
